{{!
    @template mod_ednote/note

    One teacher note on the course page.

    Both states are rendered: the guidance, and the confirmation shown after it is hidden. The AMD
    module toggles the hidden attribute between the two regions, so undo needs no round trip.

    The hide controls are ordinary links to hidden.php carrying a sesskey, so the note still works
    with JavaScript off - mod_ednote/note intercepts them only when it can finish the job itself.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * cmid int
    * presetid int - 0 for a note that is not showing a preset's guidance
    * body string - already cleaned HTML, rendered unescaped
    * missing bool - the linked preset has gone, so the body may be out of date
    * hidenoteurl string
    * hidenotescope string
    * haspreset bool
    * hideguidanceurl string
    * hideguidancescope string

    Example context (json):
    {
        "cmid": 42,
        "presetid": 7,
        "body": "<p>Set the due date before releasing this to students.</p>",
        "missing": false,
        "hidenoteurl": "#",
        "hidenotescope": "hiddennote",
        "haspreset": true,
        "hideguidanceurl": "#",
        "hideguidancescope": "hiddenguidance"
    }
}}
<div class="ednote-card"
    data-region="ednote"
    data-cmid="{{cmid}}"
    data-presetid="{{presetid}}"
>
    <div class="ednote-card-header">
        <span class="ednote-card-title">{{#str}} title, mod_ednote {{/str}}</span>
        <span class="ednote-card-scope">{{#str}} onlyyou, mod_ednote {{/str}}</span>
    </div>

    <div data-region="ednote-live">
        {{#missing}}
            <div class="alert alert-info" role="alert">{{#str}} guidancemissing, mod_ednote {{/str}}</div>
        {{/missing}}

        <div class="ednote-card-body">{{{body}}}</div>

        <div class="ednote-card-actions">
            <a href="{{hidenoteurl}}"
                class="ednote-card-action"
                data-action="ednote-hide"
                data-scope="{{hidenotescope}}"
            >{{#str}} hidethisnote, mod_ednote {{/str}}</a>
            {{#haspreset}}
                <a href="{{hideguidanceurl}}"
                    class="ednote-card-action"
                    data-action="ednote-hide"
                    data-scope="{{hideguidancescope}}"
                >{{#str}} hidethisguidance, mod_ednote {{/str}}</a>
            {{/haspreset}}
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ednote-card-dismissed" data-region="ednote-dismissed" hidden>
        {{#str}} dismissed, mod_ednote {{/str}}
        {{#str}} dismissedundo, mod_ednote {{/str}}
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-link p-0 align-baseline" data-action="ednote-undo">
            {{#str}} undo, mod_ednote {{/str}}
        </button>
    </div>
</div>
